Search for the seed of the late-time departure of code E (Paper F, Sec. "The seed of the late-time departure"); v1=950, B=3e-3, k=3/2, m=5, hs=0.2, hv=0.1, ray U=0.9968.
Entries: v*sigma_v at v = 500, 600, 650, 700, 740, 780.  (Scratch scripts, not shipped: the column/row builders were run with other integrator tolerances; the shipped gen_e.py has the correction.)

